      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SONIC AVENGER (8) crossed over from out wide but caught the leaders turning before drawing clear to score (25.24) at this track in a Maiden H over 450m. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. Sure to prove hard to beat. AUTUMN GOLD (6) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (25.49) at this track over 450m. Overdue and expected to feature again. YUKON (1) proved too good on debut over 450m at this track to score by one length (25.60). Drawn to take advantage of good early pace. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. PALE GREEN STAR (5) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish from this box.",
